From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Huang Qiqi <huangqiqi@loongson.cn>
Date: Fri, 16 May 2025 15:55:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 77/91] LOONGARCH64: Optimize register allocation to use
 RID_TMP instead of ra_scratch

---
 src/lj_asm_loongarch64.h | 111 +++++++++++++++------------------------
 1 file changed, 41 insertions(+), 70 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/lj_asm_loongarch64.h b/src/lj_asm_loongarch64.h
index 7bafefd3..ebbcb737 100644
--- a/src/lj_asm_loongarch64.h
+++ b/src/lj_asm_loongarch64.h
@@ -355,11 +355,9 @@ static void asm_retf(ASMState *as, IRIns *ir)
   irt_setmark(IR(REF_BASE)->t);  /* Children must not coalesce with BASE reg. */
